        {
          "text": "Walo, mbwali nguumwesya bulemu bwa-Leza, alimwi nguwenya ncecizibyo icizibya mbwabede Leza, nguuyumya zintu zyoonse kujwi lyakwe lili anguzu, naakamana kulituula kuti abe cituuzyo cakusalazya bantu kuzibi, wakaakukala kujulu kululyo lwacuuno ca-Leza cabupati. ",
